{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>運輸署今日（11月3日）早上9時45分公布，由於咪錶泊車系統出現故障，現未能提供服務，並指正進行搶修，運輸署稱：不便之處，敬請原諒。</p><figure><img alt=\"運輸署11月3日早上9時45分公布，由於咪錶泊車系統出現故障，未能提供服務（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250417/989608015105626112746935.jpeg/ST38JllbHYa20fsYc9FEMG0dhv4CvW_Rw-A0Y8PgNGM\"/><figcaption>運輸署11月3日早上9時45分公布，由於咪錶泊車系統出現故障，未能提供服務（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T02:03:19.830774+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T01:55:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T02:00:08.943656+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T02:00:08.943656+00:00","content_hash":"627ce06698ee79f201e11e35218be965b9945a18d27a75c99be394c5ec481313","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}